  "releaseNotes": "ZarrNET 0.8.1 improves OME-Zarr 0.6 scene handling and codec reliability:\n- Adds scene-root detection, typed SceneNode access, and navigation to referenced multiscale images.\n- Allows AsMultiscaleImageAsync and automatic root dispatch to open images referenced by scenes.\n- Fixes byDimension coordinate-transformation parsing.\n- Fixes Blosc decoding when parallel compression stores blocks out of index order.\n- Adds automated coverage for scene detection, dispatch, and image navigation.",
